> help
Commands
1. Command: help; Effect: List the commands, or explain one
2. Command: status; Effect: Show the Trace, the cycles, the deck and the forecast
3. Command: map; Effect: Show the nodes, their ICE, and where the patrols go
4. Command: move; Effect: Move to a linked node whose ICE is open
5. Command: breach; Effect: Breach the ICE of a linked node with a program
6. Command: use; Effect: Use a utility program: Cloak, Spoof, Ghost, Overclock
7. Command: loot; Effect: Take the loot of the node you are on
8. Command: end; Effect: End the turn: the patrols move and scan, the ambient Trace rises
9. Command: jackout; Effect: Jack out with the loot you took
10. Command: undo; Effect: Take back the turn under way
11. Command: quit; Effect: Leave the run
